         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Totally Equal\n\nIn the previous lesson, we saw that objects can be equal even with some differences.\n\nNow let's learn what totally equal objects are and how they stay equal over time.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "d86ec041-6b4b-41a5-9f9e-f716737d8c32",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "d86ec041-6b4b-41a5-9f9e-f716737d8c32",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "Is there a sign to show that two things are really equal?",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "5bbf69de-b8f4-4dc5-bb11-dacbb1377637",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "yes",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "5bbf69de-b8f4-4dc5-bb11-dacbb1377637",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "bb226b7f-2358-437f-b6e1-668943c682d7",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=cbf361bb-a62f-4399-9776-845a7627b195",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2024",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### A Sign, a Message\n\nTo say that something is equal, we use the symbol \"=\". Here is an example with two numbers:",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<center><span class=\"text_to_paint\">0</span> <span class=\"text_to_paint\">=</span> <span class=\"text_to_paint\">0</span></center>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "Important: once an equality is defined, it must be maintained. If we change something on one side, the other side must also change in the same way.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "5254d26b-5d27-439b-9b35-37eb366d021b",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "5254d26b-5d27-439b-9b35-37eb366d021b",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "shocking",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "bb226b7f-2358-437f-b6e1-668943c682d7",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=cbf361bb-a62f-4399-9776-845a7627b195",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2024",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "Let's see an exercise with numbers and hands, using arrows. Notice that as we change one side, the other side changes too.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><table id=\"yupana0\" class=\"tawapukllay\"><tr><th colspan=\"4\"><i>Equation</i></th><th>Left Hand</th><th>Right Hand</th><th>Arrows</th></tr> <tr id=\"tf1\"><td id=\"tc1f1\"><span class=\"text_to_paint\" id=\"leftnum\">0</span></td> <td id=\"tc2f1\" colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"text_to_paint\">=</span></td> <td id=\"tc4f1\"><span class=\"text_to_paint\" id=\"rightnum\">0</span></td><td id=\"tc5f1\" style=\"background-color:white;\"><img id=\"leftHandImg\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('leftHandImg', '0%')\"  /></td><td id=\"tc6f1\"><img id=\"rightHandImg\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('rightHandImg', '0%')\"  /></td><td id=\"tc7f1\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-caret-up upArrowWithFA\" id=\"traineeUp0\"></i>  <i class=\"fa-solid fa-caret-down downArrowWithFA\" style=\"font-size:4em;color:#00f;\" id=\"traineeDown0\"></i></td></tr></table><p class=\"desc\"><b>Table 1</b>: Maintaining equality.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "a6e92022-3a54-4d82-8137-c8045679a76b",
